{"summary":"The King of Retro Soccer!","description":"Super Soccer Champs (SSC) is back for 2022, taking Retro / Arcade soccer to new heights! \n\nTaking it's inspiration from the legendary retro games of old, Super Soccer Champs is football the way it should be : Simple, fast, flowing and with the power to play make-or-break passes and score amazing goals put firmly in your hands.\n\nTake part in a huge World of Soccer, with Continental championships and Domestic Cups as well as League play. Handle transfer negotiations, player training and scouting, or just play the matches!\n\nNew for '22 :\n+ Updated club database (optional for existing players)\n+ Side View Camera mode added\n+ Match Engine Refinements\n+ New Formations  : 3-4-3,  4-2-3-1,  4-4-1-1\n+ Sprint Meter\n\nFeatures:\n\n+ Over 600 teams\n+ 37 Divisions from 27 Countries.\n+ Manager mode\n+ International  Teams, with 2 Tournaments: Europe and South American\n+ Local Multiplayer mode using Touch and Game Controllers (up to 2 v 2)\n+ Daily Challenge mode\n+ Full Team and Player data editor\n+ Simple League mode","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zw_pPd2MX7g?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/daphRP9mAnb8fDmhR2ky1_1S05jgOwuB0Kwux_3w6MQfnFcQBdwg330JuqHPiq7OTNcSjQs0g7AHTWs_fzyFNQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QsPvPOCgMcd-fMuRs9e4RZPOha7gfR3zlB1DSnm_SOkeeIN8pSlJhrRSUBklFgK__AWIXxCnwKmKY4wK9OXzU8o","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BkekkRO2ZfC43G4AmA8iFy2-RETaORO7nEp9j0sk_ZpKO2cDD7p5FcCtRS6vCGHf2vz5wXRfGCe6NSOXq9vHlA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5pE7TwYmuOG8qDAaxt-JnRIlmlkDAJdNW9z06AH6G9t97ZUowQI8mjyKjO-BvyP1c4XOdtR0y3LGHDKWrGzcJQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Hy8DgpNgFwaGnTDFT33uP9TkkrxQnE243ZnXxR6Tk7CLuF_cQx4WZ4ewI3tUwT86wnZjqZf8ucXMfZ_qxpxepQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FOIEefG-yAG_WqfncxgJVg8yKdiVAnTxBj3PQfxOaQldFfGddmgtkjBWlnjTiuiyCbH5l5